{"id":"n27796-1-9","stage":2,"title":"추천 · 推荐","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27796-1-9-1","ko":"뭘 시켜야 할지 모르겠는데 추천 메뉴가 있나요?","zh":"我不知道该点什么，有推荐菜吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"시켜야","meaning":"点，叫","explanation":"시키다：点，叫；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"2","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시켜야","audio":"/audio/d0bfc4103feb539ff80a.mp3"}},{"text":"할지","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할지","audio":"/audio/156fd116c75acec033e4.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠는데","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠는데","audio":"/audio/94ced161216e209bf4fb.mp3"}},{"text":"추천","meaning":"推荐，举荐","explanation":"추천：推荐，举荐。","readings":[{"term":"추천","audio":"/audio/5891b70a9b6fdf41d3b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27796","senseId":"1","lemma":"추천","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추천","audio":"/audio/5891b70a9b6fdf41d3b6.mp3"}},{"text":"메뉴가","meaning":"菜品","explanation":"메뉴：菜品；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/